# Component File Structure

Each component lives in its own directory under `src/components/`:

```
src/components/<ComponentName>/
  <componentName>.jsx   ← component logic
  styles.css            ← component-scoped styles
```

- Directory names use **PascalCase** (e.g. `Fold/`, `Form/`)
- The JSX file uses **camelCase** matching the directory (e.g. `fold.jsx`)
- Every component **must** have its own `styles.css`; styles are not shared across components

See [src/components/Fold/](mdc:src/components/Fold) as the reference structure.
